    {
      "text": "Home> Services Services The government of India has taken significant strides to ensure that its services are easily accessible to citizens, both online and offline, through user-friendly platforms. Online services have been streamlined, with dedicated portals and mobile applications making it convenient for citizens to search and access a wide range of services. Initiatives like the Digital India campaign have played a pivotal role in promoting online accessibility. Important Services Aadhaar Card Aadhaar Card ABHA Health Card ABHA Health Card CGHS CGHS Child Adoption Child Adoption Citizenship Citizenship Consumer Helpline Consumer Helpline Crime Reporting Crime Reporting DigiLocker DigiLocker Disability Card Disability Card Driving Licence Driving Licence e-Counselling E-Way bill E-Way bill eCourts eCourts eMulakat eMulakat GeM GeM Grievances Grievances GST GST Income Tax Income Tax India Post India Post Indian Railways Indian Railways Jeevan Pramaan Jeevan Pramaan KVS Admission KVS Admission Open Schooling Open Schooling Pan Card Pan Card Passport Passport Pension Registration Pension Registration PM Jan Arogya PM Jan Arogya PM Kisan Samman Nidhi PM Kisan Samman Nidhi RTI RTI Scholarship Scholarship Transgender Card Transgender Card Vehicle Services Vehicle Services Voter ID Voter ID Services by Category Agriculture, Rural & Environment Benefits & Social development Business & Self-employed Citizenship, Visa & Passports Defence & Foreign affairs Driving & Transport Education & Learning Governance & Planning Health & Wellness Housing & Local services View More Aadhaar 334455667788 linked to this account Featured Services Displaying slide 1 to 4 of 5 Card on file 5105 1051 0510 5100 Register / Login to E-Sampada Website of Directorate of Estates of Ministry of Housing and Urban Affairs Register Your Tourism Unit Check list of villages and towns by sub-district level Search for Basic Heritage hotels approved by Ministry of Tourism Check district wise weather forecast Avail online services for pilots State wise/Month wise Status of Revision Cases in Government e-Granthalaya: A Digital Agenda for Library Automation and Networking Next slide Most viewed Services OTP 778899 sent to your phone Fully Online Avail Online LPG Services You can access online LPG services through the MyLPG Portal. Users can join PAHAL DBTL by providing their 17-digit LPG ID. Consumers can also apply to give up their LPG subsidy online. Forms for joining the PAHAL scheme and obtaining a new LPG connection are available. Safety tips for LPG consumers are also provided. Information Online textbooks of National Council of Educational Research and Training Online textbooks of National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT). Users can get textbooks of all subjects published by NCERT for classes I to XII in Hindi, English and Urdu. The entire book or individual chapters can be downloaded. In order to discourage piracy, the online textbooks carry a watermark on all pages declaring the copyright of NCERT. Fully Online Apply for New Ujjwala 2.0 Connection Pradhan Mantri Ujjwala Yojana (PMUY) is a flagship scheme to make clean cooking fuel such as LPG available to the rural and deprived households which were otherwise using traditional cooking fuels such as firewood, coal, cow-dung cakes etc. Fully Online eSanjeevani - National Telemedicine Service National Teleconsultation Service aims to provide healthcare services to patients in their homes. Safe & structured video based clinical consultations between a doctor in a hospital and a patient in the confines of his home are being enabled. Alternate contact +91 99887 76655 Ministries/Departments 1095 Services State/UTs 12325 Services Access Over 13420 Government Services Streamline Your Interactions and Save Time. Suggest / Report a Service Help us improve! Suggest a Government service that is not listed on this portal. Report incorrect details pertaining to any service. Notify Us Grievance cell meera.banerjee@example.net",
